<Base
  title="Best Robot Vacuums: What $200, $380, and $900 Actually Buy — DealWillow"
  description="The best robot vacuums in the US right now: Roborock's Q7 M5+ is Wirecutter's top pick at $199.99, MOVA's P50 Pro Ultra beats flagships on pet hair for about $380, and Roborock's Saros 10R is the one that fits under low furniture."
>
  <main class="wrap article">
